{"t":{"BALTIJOS BRASTA SVAJA un SVAJA+ bīdāmās durvis":"<p><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"111\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 238);\" /><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"123\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja2sh.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Du&scaron;as siena ar bīdāmām durvīm, kas ir piemērota platām ni&scaron;ām. Palīdz ekonomiski izmantot telpu</span><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Sienas augstums (mm) 1935</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja+(1).jpg\" width=\"106\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<div><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja+_.jpg\" width=\"130\" height=\"69\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" />\r\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Ļoti kompakta, ar divām durvīm. Labi izmantojama vannas istabās ar sarežģītu plānojumu.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10.6667px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Sienas augstums (mm) 1935</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>","BALTIJOS BRASTA IEVA":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"108\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva_sh1.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"84\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva_sh1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"106\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva_sh2.jpg\" alt=\"\" />Augstums 1900mm.</p>","BALTIJOS BRASTA IEVA PLUS":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva+.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"108\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva+.jpg\" /></a><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva+sh1.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"91\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva+sh1.jpg\" /></a><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva+sh2.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"105\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/ieva+sh2.jpg\" /></a>Augstums 1900mm.</p>","Baltijos Brasta GRETA un GRETA PLUS":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/greta.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"70\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/greta.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><strong>GRETA</strong></p>\r\n<p>izmērs: 795-808x1900 mm<br />\r\nStiklu veidi: caurspīdīgs, tonēts pelēks vai brūns, ar faktūru, zaļgans, zilgans, satin<br />\r\nHromēts alumīnija profils<br />\r\nDro&scaron;s 6 mm rūdīts stikls</p>\r\n<p>Pasūtot jānorāda vai durvis būs montējamas labajā vai kreisajā pusē</p>\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/greta plus.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/greta_plius.jpg\" width=\"77\" height=\"100\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" /></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>GRETA PLUS</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\">Daļēji profilēta du&scaron;as siena ar pacel&scaron;anas mehānismu durvju atvēr&scaron;anai.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","Andres dušas durvis":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/sserv/dd.jpg\"><img width=\"52\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/sserv/dd.jpg\" /></a>Du&scaron;as durvju izmēri: platums: 790; 890mm, augstums 1900mm vai 2000mm (anodēta alumīnija vai hromēta eņģe).<br />\r\n<strong>Komplektācijā ietilpst: </strong>rūdīta 6mm bieza stikla vērtne, lifta mehānisma eņģe, rokturis<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>","BALTIJOS BRASTA GABIJA bīdāmās durvis":"<p><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/gabija.jpg\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" />&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/gabijos_schema.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"71\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;\">Modelis &ldquo;Gabija&rdquo; ir ar bezramju bidamo durvju sistemu. Tas ir piemerots visam nisam, kas ir platakas par 1 m. Viegla bezramja konstrukcija nenoslogo telpu. Nav apakseja profila, tapec ieeja dusa ir bez barjeram. Laba &bdquo;bremzu&ldquo; konstrukcija atvertam un aizvertam durvim, viegla un klusa gultnu darbiba, ciesi aizvertas durvis.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;<br />\r\n</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\">Sienas augstums (mm) 2000</span></strong></div>","BALTIJOS BRASTA RITA":"<p><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/rita.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/Rita_sch.jpg\" width=\"83\" height=\"100\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" />Skandināvu stila du&scaron;as durvis ar durvju pacel&scaron;anas funkciju, tās atverot, un ar palīgsienu, paredzētas vidēja platuma ni&scaron;ām. Iespējams pasūtīt gan standarta, gan nestandarta izmērus.<br />\r\nSienas augstums (mm) 1900</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","Baltijos Brasta GODA dušas durvis ar sienu":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/goda.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/goda_maza.png\" width=\"107\" height=\"110\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" />Lielisks risinajums sauram nisam: durvis ir salokamas pie sienas un veido maksimali platu eju dusas telpa. Turklat ta ir lieliski piemerota vannasistabam, kuras nav pietiekami daudz vietas durvju atversanai uz arpusi.&nbsp; Iespejami nestandarta izmeri.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Sienas augstums (mm) 1900</span></span></strong></p>","DUSCHY DUO dubultās dušas durvis":"<p>Ni&scaron;ām paredzētas du&scaron;a durvis,&nbsp;sastāv no vienām du&scaron;a durvīm, kas&nbsp;kustās gan uz iek&scaron;u, kā arī uz āru</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Iespējams komplektēt dažādos platumos&nbsp; - 30+50cm, 40+40cm, utt.</p>\r\n<p>Ar paceļ&scaron;anas eņģi.&nbsp;</p>","DUSCHY ROUND dušas durvis":"<p>&nbsp;Apaļa caurspīdīgas stikla durvis. Iespēja izvēlēties stikla izmērs-70cm, 80cm,90cm vai 100cm. Cena norādīta par vienu durvi!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"}}